5,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I’d rather see the scars than the sketches. Let’s start by checking the condition of works from the earlier programme.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I agree. The ground here has surprised us before. We need to know what the site can actually handle before committing to any timeline.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Mio,,"I’m all for checking the old work! But honestly, I’m worried about the long-term bills. What will this cost the city to maintain every single year?","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I’m concerned about staffing. Who actually maintains this? The groundskeeping roll is shrinking. We need to know who is responsible for daily upkeep.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minako,,I agree with Benjamin. We must verify the site’s physical reality first. I will examine the drainage callouts and August heat readings to understand the ground’s behavior.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Misaki, your caution is wise. But let’s not ignore the human element. Asuka, how many hands do we actually have left for daily upkeep?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Asuka, I don’t have the current headcount. But if the roll is thin, we need to know if we’re buying in services. That affects the budget.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Asuka, if we’re buying in services, that’s a recurring cost! I’m terrified of hidden fees. Can we check the upkeep ledger spend per hectare?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Mio, the ledger shows the cost, not the capacity. I need to know if the current staff can physically cover the area.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
